  "setup": "start.sh generates compose.yml (not shipped). First boot downloads ~107 GB into ./hf-hub (bound at /hf-cache), coalesces rank-sliced TP4 EXL3 -> TP1 into ./data/tp1 (/models), builds K64 DSpark draft, runs selftest. Optional ./download.sh does download+coalesce offline. Bind-mounts from image-patch/: entrypoint-256k.sh -> /opt/recipe/scripts/entrypoint.sh, entrypoint-toolfix.sh -> /patch-run-entrypoint.sh (pip upgrades xgrammar>=0.2.4, pins transformers==5.13.1 at boot), serve-ds4-flash.sh -> /opt/vllm/serve-ds4-flash.sh, coalesce_rank_sliced_exl3.py, dspark.py, and sparkinfer kernel backports (_impl.py, tiny_decode.py, prefill.py, prefill_mg.py). ./cache -> /cache. Disable earlyoom; needs >=114.3 GiB free host RAM at launch; aarch64 only.",
